#30401
Inside the West Gate~
You have reached the westernmost extent of Apple Ave.  , the long road that
bisects the city.  Tall, mithril gates rise above you to the west, standing
open as they always are, save in times of trouble.  Guards nod politely at you,
but remain alert.  Above you, you see murderholes in the floor of the
gatehouse, allowing defenders to pour boiling oil upon any foolish enough to
storm the gates.    
~
