#30405
Inside the Western Wall~
   You are making you way along a narrow corridor that runs through the center
of the cyclopean walls of the city of Fairhaven.  Crossbow slits at regular
intervals allow you to look out upon the western plains that lie beyond the
city.  Crossbowmen walk back and forth, talking and joking but ever alert for
any signs of attack.  After a while you begin to feel slightly claustrophobic.
  
~
