#30456
Heading Along the Battlements~
   You are heading along the huge northern wall of the City of Fairhaven.  
This wall extends for at least twice the distance of the east and west walls,
protecting the vulnerable northern aspect of the city from the constant attacks
by warring raiders from the northern plains.  Peering about, you see little of
note, save the dark stretch of the Aspen Forest.  Who knows what adventures may
be found in there...?  A door leads west into northwest tower.    
~
