#30481
Heading Along the Battlements~
   You are strolling along the vast southern wall of the City of Fairhaven,
enjoying the cool breeze and the scenic view.  The guards call this the "easy
spot" because there has never been an assault from the south on the city,
mostly due to the presence of the mighty Fairhaven River, which flows parallel
to this wall.  You smile, relax and enjoy the walk.  A door to the east leads
into southeast tower.    
